        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average processes for producing melamin coated plywood panels.\n\n# Included processes\nThis data set includes the materials and resources needed for producing melamin coated plywood panels per m2. Both sides are melamin coated. The panel is 19 mm wide. Melamin has a densitiy of 1574 kg/m3. This kind of panel is used for cupboard covers. Transport is estimated according to the ecoinvent standard distances for Switzerland. Linked to updated LCI of particle boards from Ecoinvent data v3.2 for KBOB recommendation 2016.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
